<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Track Order • RakuShopBD</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/rakushopbd-logo.png" type="image/png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/tabler-icons.min.css" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --primary: #206020;
        --primary-dark: #164816;
        --primary-pale: #e8f5e8;
        --accent: #d48696;
        --bg: #f5f5f5;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --surface2: #f8f8f8;
        --border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        --text: #1a1a1a;
        --text-muted: #6b6b6b;
        --radius: 16px;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 12% 0%, rgba(32, 96, 32, 0.08), transparent 55%),
          radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 88% 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08), transparent 55%),
          var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      .top {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .top-inner {
        max-width: 1040px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .brand {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        font-weight: 900;
      }
      .brand img {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      }
      .top-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
      .top-btn {
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--text);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 9px 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        cursor: pointer;
        text-decoration: none;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .top-btn.primary {
        border: none;
        color: #fff;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
        box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(32, 96, 32, 0.22);
      }
      .wrap {
        max-width: 1040px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 22px 18px 46px;
      }
      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: stretch;
      }
      @media (max-width: 880px) {
        .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      }
      .card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .card-head {
        padding: 18px 18px 14px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-pale), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08));
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .title {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 900;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }
      .title i { color: var(--primary); font-size: 20px; }
      .sub {
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .card-body { padding: 16px 18px 18px; }
      .form {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .in-wrap {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 240px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: var(--surface2);
        border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      }
      .in-wrap i { color: var(--primary); font-size: 18px; }
      input {
        flex: 1;
        border: none;
        outline: none;
        background: transparent;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.2px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .btn {
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 11px 16px;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-family: inherit;
        color: #fff;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(32, 96, 32, 0.22);
      }
      .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.7; cursor: not-allowed; }
      .hint {
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #94a3b8;
      }
      .result { margin-top: 14px; }
      .res-box {
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #fff;
      }
      .res-head {
        padding: 12px 14px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 10px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .res-head b { font-weight: 1000; }
      .status {
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 1000;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--surface2);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      }
      .status.pending { background: #fef3c7; border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25); color: #92400e; }
      .status.confirmed, .status.shipped { background: #dbeafe; border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25); color: #1e40af; }
      .status.delivered { background: #dcfce7; border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.25); color: #166534; }
      .status.cancelled { background: #fee2e2; border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25); color: #991b1b; }
      .res-body { padding: 12px 14px; }
      .meta {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      @media (max-width: 520px) { .meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      .m { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }
      .m b { color: var(--text); }
      .items { border-top: 1px dashed var(--border); padding-top: 10px; }
      .it { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 6px 0; }
      .it b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 900; }
      .total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-weight: 1000; }
      .err {
        padding: 12px 14px;
        color: #991b1b;
        font-weight: 900;
        background: #fff1f2;
        border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
        border-radius: 14px;
      }
      .side {
        padding: 18px;
      }
      .step {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 12px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .step i { color: var(--primary); font-size: 20px; margin-top: 2px; }
      .step b { display: block; font-size: 13px; }
      .step span { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 2px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="top">
      <div class="top-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <img src="/images/rakushopbd-logo.png" alt="RakuShopBD" />
          <span>RakuShopBD</span>
        </a>
        <div class="top-actions">
          <a class="top-btn" href="/"><i class="ti ti-home"></i> Home</a>
          <a class="top-btn primary" href="/cart"><i class="ti ti-shopping-cart"></i> Cart</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h1 class="title"><i class="ti ti-truck-delivery"></i> Track your order</h1>
            <p class="sub">Enter your Order ID (example: <b>RKS-2026-12345678</b>) to see status and details.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <form class="form" id="trk-form" onsubmit="return false;">
              <div class="in-wrap">
                <i class="ti ti-receipt"></i>
                <input id="trk-order-id" type="text" placeholder="RKS-2026-........" autocomplete="off" />
              </div>
              <button type="button" class="btn" id="trk-submit"><i class="ti ti-search"></i> Track</button>
            </form>
            <div class="hint">Tip: Order ID আপনার Success page‑এ “Order ID” এর পাশে থাকে।</div>

            <div class="result" id="trk-result" hidden></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h2 class="title"><i class="ti ti-info-circle"></i> How it works</h2>
            <p class="sub">Order ID দিয়ে track করলে আপনি status, items এবং total দেখতে পারবেন।</p>
          </div>
          <div class="side">
            <div class="step">
              <i class="ti ti-receipt"></i>
              <div><b>1) Copy Order ID</b><span>Success page থেকে Order ID কপি করুন (RKS‑2026‑...).</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <i class="ti ti-search"></i>
              <div><b>2) Paste & Track</b><span>এই পেজে paste করে “Track” চাপুন।</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <i class="ti ti-package"></i>
              <div><b>3) View status</b><span>Pending/Confirmed/Shipped/Delivered status দেখুন।</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script>window.RAKU_API_BASE='';</script>
    <script src="/js/track.js?v=1" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>

